                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly, if you grew up playing those old flash slime volleyball or soccer games on school computers, this hits the nostalgia spot perfectly. It is basically that exact formula but on steroids, featuring four different sports and a ton of weird character abilities.\r\n\r\nPlaying solo gets old pretty fast. The bots are either completely braindead or basically Neo from the Matrix on higher difficulties, no in-between. A bit clunky around the edges, with occasional physics jank and clipping.\r\n\r\nGrab it on a sale if you want a dumb, fun casual game to mess around with a buddy. Worth a look for the couch co-op alone.",
